  "description": "Arturia MicroFreak hybrid synthesizer: every controller of its manual's CC chart (Appendix D).",
  "sources": [
    {
      "type": "manual",
      "title": "MicroFreak User Manual 5.0.1",
      "notes": "MIDI CC chart (pages 146, 147 of the PDF) read by tools/profiles/arturia/read-arturia-cc.mjs from microfreak_Manual_5_0_1_EN.pdf (sha256 e2d41791cc32f2e4425fb82cdcd3a42f08b9b5f1a54aeed7eb0cb4805760724f), https://dl.arturia.net/products/microfreak/manual/microfreak_Manual_5_0_1_EN.pdf. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/arturia/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/arturia/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a row of the manual's MIDI CC chart, with its printed name, sent as a control change on the channel variable. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "The chart prints controller numbers only: every value is the controller's 0 - 127, and a setting chosen from a list (a waveform, an oscillator type) is a number here, not a choice.",
    "Oscillator Wave (CC 10) chooses within the oscillator type CC 9 selects; for the Speech oscillator the manual's Appendix A prints which values choose which category of words. That is not laid out."
  ],
